# Doors OS (Cinnamon): Print Screen abre o Flameshot (capturar, anotar, desfocar, copiar)
[org/cinnamon/desktop/keybindings/media-keys]
screenshot=@as []

[org/cinnamon/desktop/keybindings]
custom-list=['doors-flameshot']

[org/cinnamon/desktop/keybindings/custom-keybindings/doors-flameshot]
name='Flameshot'
command='flameshot gui'
binding=['Print']
